/623be38e019781bf371faab6450c9d85.poster.avif?t=1728309359\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2404770/extras/623be38e019781bf371faab6450c9d85.webm?t=1728309359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2404770/extras/623be38e019781bf371faab6450c9d85.mp4?t=1728309359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Just do anything to make sure you don't become another one in the line of the next KFC frier, and save your legacy from that doomed fate!</strong>",
